Rolf Huebscher wrote:
> 
>  I installed tru64 4.0F. Unfortunately the graphic card, a digital
> product with 4 MB, is now defective. I inserted now a new Elsa Gloria
> synergy. How do I merge the new graphic card into the system?
> 
> In advance the best thanks for your assistance.

Insert these line into the /usr/sys/conf/COMPUTERNAME file:

 controller      comet0     at pcix      slot  n

where "x" is the pci controller number and "n" is the
slot number.
In my DPW433au is x = 0 and slot is 12.
You can figure out this values in the srm console - command
>>>show config.
Or yo build an new kernel with the GENERIC file. 
Don't forget to install the O3D Software for the 4D10T graphics
adapter (Elsa Gloria Synergie).
O3DDWSCMT491   DWS Open3D PowerStorm 4D10T V4.9A
O3DDWSBASE491  DWS Open3D Base V4.9A

You can forget this in TRU64 5.0x!

BR
