this 'few minute hangup' problem is related to the VM management. You run
into it, if your processes force the machine into heavy paging activity.
It was always there (3.2x and 4.0x), but became much harder with V4.0D. The
single patch was known as "VM performance patch", but I always think in
patchkits, not in single patches.
I don't remember the exact patchkit number for your V4.0D system, but
patchkit#4 or higher should be OK.

Eckhardt





