2 up on a page and IIRC, 4 up on a page as well as double sided printing and has a good
selection of fonts. 

Excellent package and compiles right out of the box with the 4.0D native compiler (cc).

/etc/printcap entry looks something like:

ps1|Postscript:\
  :lp=/dev/lp0:\
  :pl=66:\
  :pw=132:\
  :of:/usr/lbin/lpf:\
  :xf=/usr/lbin/xf:\
  :sd=/usr/spool/ps:\
  :lf=/dev/console:\
  :sh:\
  :sf:


