information in "Quick Setup" when I should have hit the
"Custom Setup" and entered the data there.  So if you
are reading this and you are planning to get T64, avoid
this pitfall.  I was on the phone for 45 min with Compaq,
routed through 5 different people, before ending up
talking with someone who had absolutely no idea what I
did.  My fault though.

