Modify your ASE service and set the Automatic Service Placement Policy to "Restrict to Favored Members", and only list the ASE member that has the tape library as a Favored Member. For example:

# asemgr

m) Managing ASE Services
c) Service Configuration
m) Modify a Service

(Select your ASE tape service)

a) Automatic service placement (ASP) Policy
r) Restrict to Favored Members

(only select the member with the tape drive)

Answer "n", then "y" to modify the service.

--> Jay


