problems.  When the system reboots after the initial software load the =
system halts just after checking the logical drives and LSM config.  It =
gives a halt code =3D 5.

  I've verified that os_type =3D UNIX (also set it to OSF), bootdef_dev =
is correct....  I also managed to blow out and reconfigure the array =
controllers, so they seem to be working well.

