the license info is required.. without it .. nothing works.

as for the net stuff.. check your /etc/inetd.conf file..  it should be
populated with services and port numbers.. if its empty.. search the /etc
dir for a similar .conf file for inet and copy the info over.  after that..
it should work fine.

